{"synopsis":"Suatu hari, menara-menara hitam misterius tiba-tiba muncul di seluruh dunia, dan beberapa orang terpilih mulai terbangun.\n\nNamun bagi Bong Ju-Hyuk—seorang pria lemah dan sial yang tak berarti apa-apa—hal itu seharusnya tidak ada hubungannya dengannya.\n\nSetelah hari yang melelahkan di pekerjaan paruh waktunya, dia hampir saja menggigit mie ramen ketika—\n\n\\[Tuan Bong Ju-Hyuk, Telah Awakening.]\n\n“…Eh, sial, apa ini?!”\n\nApakah ini akhirnya kesempatan baginya untuk mengubah hidupnya?","alternative_title":"하남자의 탑 공략법","author":"Kuchikuchi, Pyopyo","artist":"Plan A","chapters":[{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"79723d2a-4e6c-4e73-a71d-7bc74b4ad287","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"385e07b4-acc6-43ba-ae9c-e8cda2ae3036","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-07-26"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"230e0c7f-f2cc-47d5-8ee5-8a0a65eb9741","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-07-19"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"c6117169-680a-4027-89f7-1d978a3c1ba3","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-07-13"},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"6d937ed1-a549-4698-a691-a8b8670943e5","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-07-05"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"9cca2463-e1db-45bc-b00b-e04f2ffdf059","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-06-29"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"5e0ac7e7-f8c7-4437-9e30-b5c278e51658","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-06-29"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"d6ce3ced-af3c-46b5-8eb1-437b0c354f54","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-06-29"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"0616ce3c-f070-43e4-bb28-47374bfd2963","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-06-27"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"9a630a54-f160-445f-a250-ac10e0ef7df8","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-06-26"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"6db6cb6d-0a7b-4d4d-8d4d-3722badfa737","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-06-26"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"4c4c8689-1213-4533-97ef-842ed6e4a4c2","title":"Chapter 29","da